1
00:00:01,434 --> 00:00:05,905
Part Four: Local Rinses for 
Pain Control in the Mouth

2
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:12,012
Sometimes the mucositis worsens
in the mouth, causing you pain.

3
00:00:12,012 --> 00:00:16,349
In that case, we can use two specific
rinses to help decrease the pain

4
00:00:16,349 --> 00:00:21,021
locally in the mouth without causing you
any systemic side effects.

5
00:00:21,021 --> 00:00:24,758
These are medications
that you can rinse and spit out.

6
00:00:25,158 --> 00:00:27,560
Doxepin Mouth Rinse

7
00:00:28,261 --> 00:00:33,099
Take the doxepin as prescribed
and mix 1 to 1 with water.

8
00:00:33,099 --> 00:00:36,002
Take 2.5ml of doxepin

9
00:00:36,002 --> 00:00:39,205
and mix with 2.5ml of water.

10
00:00:39,205 --> 00:00:42,776
This will be a total of five milliliters.

11
00:00:42,776 --> 00:00:46,212
Rinse for 30 seconds and then spit out.

12
00:00:50,216 --> 00:00:53,219
Morphine Mouth Rinse

13
00:00:53,319 --> 00:00:56,890
Take 5 to 10ml of morphine.

14
00:00:57,290 --> 00:01:01,061
Dilute 1 to 1 with water

15
00:01:01,261 --> 00:01:04,998
and swish and spit out the medication.

16
00:01:08,802 --> 00:01:12,172
Both of these will require prescriptions
from your doctor.

17
00:01:12,172 --> 00:01:14,774
So please be sure to check with your doctor 

18
00:01:14,774 --> 00:01:17,677
and ask if a prescription is right for you.

19
00:01:17,944 --> 00:01:22,382
If pain still persists after all attempts to help mucositis-

20
00:01:22,382 --> 00:01:24,417
baking soda/MuGard rinse, 

21
00:01:24,417 --> 00:01:26,486
lidocaine rinse and swallow,

22
00:01:26,486 --> 00:01:29,155
 and doxepin/morphine rinse and spit-

23
00:01:29,155 --> 00:01:31,958
please watch the pain management videos.
